  "name": "Chicken Caesar Pasta Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled pasta salad with chicken, vegetables, eggs, Parmesan, and Caesar dressing.",
  "description": "Tender mini penne is combined with chopped chicken, crisp vegetables, eggs, Parmesan, and creamy Caesar dressing, then chilled before serving.",
